            "id": 147949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngüyü çalıştır: <code>i</code> sayaç değişkenini, <code>inventory</code> içindeki tüm öğeleri görüntülemek için dizin olarak kullan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>inventory</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve sonra <code>i</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
